cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the PaRAGraph Casebook, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "PaRAGraph Casebook: source-grounded cases in Yue dialect classification and tone inventories"
version: "0.3"
date-released: 2026-10-04
abstract: >-
  Companion casebook to the PaRAGraph article: four source-grounded cases in Yue
  (Cantonese) dialectology. Each case pairs a short narrative with the slice of the
  PaRAGraph knowledge graph behind it — claims, quoted evidence and sources — and a set
  of graph operations that the static viewer recomputes in the browser and compares
  with results recorded on the production graph.
